afe at all anymore after recent events. You, a regular working Joe, decide to take things into your own hands after a spontaneous decision. Will you regret or accept your new destiny?\n\nThis game features many things that might peak your attention such as:\nAn hour long scary experience depending on pace\nA horror experience filled with scares\nComplete voice acting for each character\nLighthearted writing and amusing moments\nA dark city full of secrets to explore\nEnvironments to keep you on edge\nAnd much more!\n\nMaybe today was a day that you should've stayed in bed.\nBut who am I to decide on your decisions in the end...\nYou want to save her don't you?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/unusual-tales-deep-below", "videos": [{"id": 170167, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "6c2mFdXv9ek", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6c2mFdXv9ek", "title": "Unusual Tales: Deep Below Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6c2mFdXv9ek/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}